THIS IS NOT OPEN-SOURCE SOFTWARE. This repository is made visible solely so that
judges of the 9th Chuanzhi Cup contest can verify the authenticity of the project
and the AI-assisted development process. Visibility is not permission to copy,
share, modify or reuse.

Granted: a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable
license for contest judges to read the code, and to temporarily clone, build,
run and test it on their own devices, for evaluation purposes only and only
during the evaluation period.

Prohibited without prior written permission: copying (beyond transient copies
needed for evaluation); redistributing, publishing, forking or mirroring;
modifying or creating derivative works; any commercial or production use;
using the code, rules, prompts, data or designs to train or tune AI models or to
build similar or competing products; removing notices; and using the project's
names or marks to imply endorsement.

Third-party components remain under their own licenses. The software is provided
"as is", without warranty. The license terminates automatically at the end of
the evaluation period, on written notice, or upon any breach; on termination all
copies must be deleted. For other uses, contact the rights holder in writing.
